Subject: [PATCH] Update Jailbreak button with icon and gradient

Updated the Jailbreak button to include a bolt icon, gradient background, and hover animation for improved visual appeal and user experience.
---
 templates/index.html | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/templates/index.html b/templates/index.html
index 57766c3..ee7f910 100644
--- a/templates/index.html
+++ b/templates/index.html
@@ -99,8 +99,9 @@ <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold opacity-50 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Conne
             </div>
 
             <div class="flex flex-col">
-                <button id="SJB" class="flex-1 w-full bg-brand-blue hover:bg-brand-light text-white font-bold text-2xl rounded-2xl shadow-lg transition-all transform active:scale-[0.98] flex items-center justify-center tracking-widest uppercase">
-                    Jailbreak
+                <button id="SJB" class="group flex-1 w-full bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-brand-light hover:to-blue-500 text-white font-bold text-2xl rounded-2xl shadow-lg transition-all transform active:scale-[0.98] flex items-center justify-center gap-4 tracking-widest uppercase">
+                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-3xl group-hover:animate-pulse"></i>
+                    <span>Jailbreak</span>
                 </button>
             </div>
         </section>
